WEBVTT

00:59:28.916 --> 00:59:32.886
especially countries
with a large population

00:59:32.910 --> 00:59:36.314
and not any high-tech companies.

00:59:36.338 --> 00:59:39.377
They might have been looking
for the China model

00:59:39.401 --> 00:59:41.070
of outsourced manufacturing,

00:59:41.094 --> 00:59:46.620
or the India model
of the outsourced IT or service,

00:59:46.644 --> 00:59:49.197
but those jobs are going to be
displaced by AI,

00:59:49.221 --> 00:59:51.665
because the very fact
they can be outsourced

00:59:51.689 --> 00:59:53.324
means they can be displaced.

00:59:53.348 --> 00:59:56.085
So the China model,
the India model don't work,

00:59:56.109 --> 01:00:00.029
and the number of workers
being displaced is significant,